  "label": "Author's Note",
  "title": "NOTE FROM THE AUTHOR",
  "shortTitle": "Authors Note",
  "file": "chapters/05-authors-note.json",
  "index": 5,
  "sourceRange": [
    68,
    82
  ],
  "elements": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "This book is not written to point out who is right or wrong. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 69
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It is simply a reflection of what I have observed, experienced, and thought "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 70
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "about while trying to understand relationships more deeply. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 71
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "I am not speaking against parents, nor against children. In my understanding, "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 72
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "both sides are right in their own way. Both are carrying their own emotions, "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 73
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "fears, responsibilities, and perspectives. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 74
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Sometimes what I have written may feel true, and sometimes it may feel "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 75
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "incomplete — because every reader has lived a different version of the same "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 76
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "reality. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 77
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "This book is not a final truth. It is just one way of seeing things. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 78
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "My intention is not to judge anyone, but to observe how misunderstandings are "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 79
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "created even when love exists on both sides. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 80
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "If this book helps someone pause, think, or understand a situation a little "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 81
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "differently, then its purpose is fulfilled."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 82
    }
  ],
  "headerSourceParagraphs": {
    "title": 68
  },
  "suppressHeaderNumber": true,
